	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t02r0202_man1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんでも　はいる　すごい
バッグを　もっているんだ！▽
これも　いれておきなよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T06:57:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんでも　入る　すごい
バッグを　持っているんだ！▽
これも　いれておきなよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T06:57:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手処理
　No580「かおるキノコ」
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T06:56:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN1
青年１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T06:55:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
